{"schemaVersion":1,"id":495,"sections":[{"id":"1914001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20668],"start":0,"count":15},{"id":"1914001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20669],"start":15,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:1","scriptId":20668,"text":"诱饵战术已经使用过很多次，所以小队成员都轻车熟路。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:2","scriptId":20668,"text":"除了安妮不太习惯这种打带跑的作战以外，其他人基本顺利完成了任务。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:3","scriptId":20668,"text":"“好了，敌人已经都到达了指定坐标地点，那么接下来……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:4","scriptId":20668,"text":"“我按……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:5","scriptId":20668,"text":"按下开关之后，并没有什么显著的变化，于是我又按了几下。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:6","scriptId":20668,"text":"“呃……难道是摔坏了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:7","scriptId":20668,"text":"“不过波西娅博士的东西，也不能说都管用吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:8","scriptId":20668,"text":"“虽然不知道是什么等级的火力支援，但现在好像什么都没发生？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:9","scriptId":20668,"text":"“这下不是我们不靠谱了吧，是波西娅的仪器——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:14","scriptId":20668,"text":"突然巨大的爆炸声响彻天际，敌人的队伍被巨大的爆炸所席卷……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:15","scriptId":20668,"text":"不过与此同时巨大的气浪带着树叶和沙砾向我们袭来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:16","scriptId":20668,"text":"“妈呀……这是什么威力……波西娅到底有没有考虑过会溅射范围？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:17","scriptId":20668,"text":"“真是危险……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:18","scriptId":20668,"text":"还好奈特莉和佩妮反应神速，扔出露营帐篷当做缓冲，抵挡了大部分的砂石。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1914001-PROLOGUE:20668:19","scriptId":20668,"text":"“这好像靠谱过头了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:1","scriptId":20669,"text":"突如其来的巨大炮击撕碎了旅行者的部队……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:2","scriptId":20669,"text":"“这是什么情况！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:3","scriptId":20669,"text":"没有直接参与战斗的奥米克戎和柯西只能干瞪眼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:4","scriptId":20669,"text":"“是超远距离打击吧，没想到人类还有这种武器……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:5","scriptId":20669,"text":"“不行，得去通知西格玛，如果被敌人发现我们的新据点就遭了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:6","scriptId":20669,"text":"“那我去？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:7","scriptId":20669,"text":"“不行，你的话我不放心，你负责指挥剩下的实验体让她们去拖延时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:8","scriptId":20669,"text":"“好的好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1914001-EPILOGUE:20669:9","scriptId":20669,"text":"（反正也是送死的炮灰，让她们自由行动好了。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
